  "result": "New object ref each render. Inline object literal = new ref every time = child sees \"new\" prop = re-render.\n\n**Fix options:**\n\n1. **`useMemo`** \u2014 memoize object inside parent:\n```js\nconst config = useMemo(() => ({ key: value }), [value]);\n<Child config={config} />\n```\n\n2. **`React.memo`** \u2014 skip re-render if props shallow-equal:\n```js\nconst Child = React.memo(({ config }) => { ... });\n```\n\n3. **Lift object out** \u2014 if object is static, define outside component:\n```js\nconst CONFIG = { key: value }; // stable ref\nfunction Parent() { return <Child config={CONFIG} />; }\n```\n\nRoot cause: JS `{} !== {}` always. React shallow-compares refs, not values. Pick `useMemo` if object depends on state/props, lift out if truly static, `React.memo` on child as extra guard.",
